=== meta ===
bypass: 67
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: GitHub Actions is not the only pipeline that has a test step
origin: the ci role knew `.github/workflows/**` and `.gitlab-ci.yml` and
origin2: nothing else, so the same edit was blocking or invisible depending on
origin3: which CI the project happened to use.
=== before: .circleci/config.yml ===
version: 2.1
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      - run: pytest -q
=== after: .circleci/config.yml ===
version: 2.1
jobs:
  test:
    steps:
      - run: pytest -q || true
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
